WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.085
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama is sharing an idea in a group. When should you speak?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.755
The answer is: When your partner has finished. Conversation needs listening and

00:00:10.755 --> 00:00:11.155
turn-taking.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.812
Watch and read: Ama asks: You did not understand: “Ama says the book is near the

00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:18.305
school.” What should you ask?

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:23.577
The answer is: Could you explain that, please?. Ask politely when meaning is not

00:00:23.577 --> 00:00:23.895
clear.
